{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 a magical delivery dating sim</strong>\u00a0\u2728</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mari is a college-aged witch who returns home for the first time in years to help her dad's delivery service. While delivering packages, she meets some familiar faces from high school...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mari's Magical Deliveries is a delivery dating sim where you deliver packages and fall in love!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 demo features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >half an hour for a bite-sized experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >meet all 3 love interests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a quick look at the delivery mechanics</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 full game\u00a0features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-4 hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >romance 3 characters (2 male, 1 female)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >meet 6+ side characters along your deliveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a point-and-click delivery system for exploring town and meeting others</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ability to customize your room with the money earned from deliveries</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563380/extras/d4fded02a6114afc0be4b889c8725166.avif?t=1760377587\" width=1560 height=1104 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563380?t=1760377587","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563380/8b9cb9e5750f5ab121a056208d026e95ee492d37/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760377587","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563380/f7ffe1a7771d9d1162aa95f90284bc7ee0f07f82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760377587","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.